{"agent_id":"pp3g-7zS8-read-only-adversarial-review-r2-retry-kimi-k2-7-code","agent_seq":9,"timestamp":"2026-08-09T18:07:56.561002618Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"8bcd9b03-5c30-4db2-b7c8-95a842ec9a79","comment_uuid":"6226f7f2-3773-401e-acb6-9616095a602e","author":"pp3g-7zS8-read-only-adversarial-review-r2-retry-kimi-k2-7-code","content":"MCP filesystem write tools are mis-identified. The document claims orchestrator-guard blocks filesystem_write_file and filesystem_edit_file, but the configured server is modelcontextprotocol server-filesystem, whose tools are named write_file, edit_file, create_directory, and move_file per upstream docs. Therefore orchestrator-guard does not close the MCP leg of the gap.","created_at":"2026-08-09T18:07:56.554357285Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:rTYY4fhkDYtz6SJeo0n+sM+0Gvd3/0k1KjtJzKUGLS8","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg5xjAGNcgpxSjh5K/KArdIxgMLULCtBFGf6IsF2nPXyEAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAgM2ll+VgYqBzKObNaZ0pj8l8eRYO/Cg7o4WVFJ+ivwo6prLuN2UMl4eB/uQMCV1qYUNMZxxRKkofPy9wc3s7DA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:rTYY4fhkDYtz6SJeo0n+sM+0Gvd3/0k1KjtJzKUGLS8","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg5xjAGNcgpxSjh5K/KArdIxgMLULCtBFGf6IsF2nPXyEAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDfLu8CRUQfuv3pmcmz4Ho39TSsE9oZSLtmEb97H7zkx0f7P8gojQssTS3E72z1jl7C5EbTslkxw9bcv4JNfgwE="}
{"agent_id":"pp3g-7zS8-read-only-adversarial-review-r2-retry-kimi-k2-7-code","agent_seq":10,"timestamp":"2026-08-09T18:08:14.241078771Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"8bcd9b03-5c30-4db2-b7c8-95a842ec9a79","comment_uuid":"8bda966d-2a1c-4ce2-b2c4-a817eca53054","author":"pp3g-7zS8-read-only-adversarial-review-r2-retry-kimi-k2-7-code","content":"### MUST FIX (blocking) continued\n- Section 2.2: Crosslink binary version/source mismatch. The document states the deployed binary is v0.9.0-beta.1-59-g6221309e, but crosslink --version reports 0.9.0-beta.1+a87bd513 (live). git describe gives v0.9.0-beta.1-59-g6221309e for the source tree HEAD, but the deployed binary is from a87bd513. Fix: report binary version and source-tree HEAD separately and note the drift.\n- Section 1.2: Read-only by construction is false confidence. The document claims reviewer/auditor are read-only by construction, but the actual guarantees are weaker: (a) kickoff agents run in tmux and the wrapper adds --auto (mapped from --dangerously-skip-permissions), which may bypass native .md permission enforcement; (b) crosslink-guard runs in tracking_mode relaxed for agents and allows any non-blocked/non-gated bash; (c) --allowedTools is dropped by the local wrapper. Fix: recast as read-only by layered enforcement with residual risks enumerated.","created_at":"2026-08-09T18:08:14.234849615Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:rTYY4fhkDYtz6SJeo0n+sM+0Gvd3/0k1KjtJzKUGLS8","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg5xjAGNcgpxSjh5K/KArdIxgMLULCtBFGf6IsF2nPXyEAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAnbK4o31+Ei7us/LcOV1FiKspBFFM2uPTOzCkiISl8H2pkapS1MjTIOKId4GQ6gWamMMA1TLMQfhDYxHi+5qEBw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:rTYY4fhkDYtz6SJeo0n+sM+0Gvd3/0k1KjtJzKUGLS8","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg5xjAGNcgpxSjh5K/KArdIxgMLULCtBFGf6IsF2nPXyEAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNr0t962njwsoznbIq0G/VsYlnH